%% ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%% fh-exam.sty — Slim exam scaffolding
%%
%% Changelog
%%
%% v3.19  (2026/02/18)
%%   • Updated instructions wording (take-home block).
%%   • itemize level-1 bullets default to an en-dash (–) instead of discs.
%%     Opt-out: \setexamitemizebullet{disc}
%%
%% v3.18  (2025/12/04)
%%   • Added take-home exam mode:
%%       - New \examstyle{takehome} switch.
%%       - Automatically replaces standard instructions with a take-home–specific block.
%%       - Added support for instructor email in upright roman inside instructions.
%%   • Refactored instruction system:
%%       - Introduced \setexamfullinstructions for full block replacement.
%%       - Preserved backward compatibility with legacy instruction knobs
%%         (\examtimeallowed, \examnotesheets, \examdevices, etc.).
%%   • Cleaned up package structure:
%%       - Removed stray nested \makeatletter/\makeatother that caused compilation issues.
%%       - Ensured all user-facing macros remain override-safe.
%%
%% v3.17a (2025/11/07)
%%   • Added optional second argument to \examstatsstemleaf for custom header titles.
%%   • Fixed decimal-leakage bug for fractional input scores.
%%   • Consolidated rounding behavior across statistical summaries.
%%   • Compatible with v3.16d and earlier exam documents.
%%
%% v3.16c (2025/10/23)
%%   • Automatically appends Academic Integrity statement after instructions.
%%
%% v3.15b–v3.15.2
%%   • Removed IQR from summary statistics, retaining quartiles.
%%   • Fixed spacing in instructions block.
%%
%% v3.15  (2025)
%%   • Wrapped entire file in \makeatletter...\makeatother for robust @-macro handling.
%%   • Added geometry guards, header fixes, and stable SD / median / quartile computation.
%%
%% ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

